{"code": "await tools.pwsh({ description: "Remove probe files", command: "Remove-Item -Force tmp/sheaf/xif/paper/_S1920Probe0.lean,tmp/sheaf/xif/paper/_S1920OleanImportCheck.lean -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; Get-ChildItem tmp/sheaf/xif/paper -Filter '_S1920*' | Select-Object Name | Format-Table -AutoSize | Out-String" });
